   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Governance: Entra ID · managed identity · Key Vault · Private Link · Purview labels · region / data-zone control · synthetic data only in the POC\nQuality: golden-set scoreboard (product top-1 / top-3, share-class confusion, topic F1, leaks = 0) · learned aliases · p50 / p95 latency\nEconomics and config: per-call meter (audio minutes, tokens) → cost per call (illustrative) · templates, taxonomy, markets, thresholds are data",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Governance: Entra ID · managed identity · Key Vault · Private Link · Purview labels · region / data-zone control · synthetic data only in the POC\nQuality: golden-set scoreboard (product top-1 / top-3, share-class confusion, topic F1, leaks = 0) · learned aliases · p50 / p95 latency\nEconomics and config: per-call meter (audio minutes, tokens) → cost per call (illustrative) · templates, taxonomy, markets, thresholds are data",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
